<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal sets 60 bln esc variable rate repo.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal sets 60 bln esc variable rate repo.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal offered to inject 60 billion escudos of four-day funds into the money market in a second variable rate securities repurchase tender.</p>
<p>Bids for the repo funds must be submitted by 1230 GMT.</p>
<p>Earler, the Bank injected 40 billion escudos at 6,3247 percent.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
